2026-11-06 story-map.md / story-map.drawio (integrated harness map)
Mistake: merged each Session Board story with its Chat Bar mirror into one story with Board and Chat bar lines, and kept the framework epics grouped by subject.
Correction: the board and the chat bar are separate channels, so each gets its own epic, sub-epics and stories; the whole map reads register and install, then invoke through slash commands, then the channels. Every story carries its actor in the drawio.
2026-11-06 story-map.md (Invoke Through Slash Commands epic)
Mistake: stories named after mechanisms and the action that runs them (Partition Context Guidance, Route Hook Payload, Search Folder Extract), so nothing said what context guidance is for.
Correction: the epic is Deliver Work With Context Guidance: invoke a practice at a fidelity, turn source into context, shape the solution, produce the artifacts, check them against the rules, and inject guidance into the chat at key moments. Each story says what it does for the person and cites its source.
